flowchart TB
    GW["API Gateway"]

    IAM["1. Identity and Access Service<br/>Login, Users, Roles and Permissions, Profile"]
    IAMDB[("auth_db")]
    IAM --- IAMDB

    ACAD["2. Academic Structure Service<br/>Calendar, Programs, Curriculum, Catalog, Offerings"]
    ACADDB[("academic_db")]
    ACAD --- ACADDB

    ENR["3. Enrollment Service<br/>Program and Course Registration, Capacity, Waitlist"]
    ENRDB[("enrollment_db")]
    ENR --- ENRDB

    GRADE["4. Assignment and Grading Service<br/>Assignments, Submissions, Grading"]
    GRADEDB[("grading_db")]
    GRADE --- GRADEDB

    NOTIF["5. Notification Service<br/>Email and In-App Notifications"]
    NOTIFDB[("notification_db")]
    NOTIF --- NOTIFDB

    ANALYTICS["6. Analytics and Reporting Service<br/>Dashboards, Reports"]
    ANALYTICSDB[("analytics_db")]
    ANALYTICS --- ANALYTICSDB

    REF["7. Reference Data Service<br/>Faculties, Grading Scales, Categories"]
    REFDB[("reference_db")]
    REF --- REFDB

    GW --> IAM
    GW --> ACAD
    GW --> ENR
    GW --> GRADE
    GW --> ANALYTICS
    GW --> REF

    ENR -->|validates| ACAD
    ACAD -->|resolves| REF
    GRADE -->|validates| ENR
    GRADE -->|resolves| REF

    MQ{{Message Broker}}
    ENR -.-> MQ
    GRADE -.-> MQ
    ACAD -.-> MQ
    IAM -.-> MQ
    MQ -.-> NOTIF
    MQ -.-> ANALYTICS

    ANALYTICS -->|reads| IAM
    ANALYTICS -->|reads| ACAD
    ANALYTICS -->|reads| ENR
    ANALYTICS -->|reads| GRADE
